[{"answer":"OK, Stewart. We need to start planning our paper on public libraries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you thought of an angle yet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there's so much we could look into.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/3.mp3"},{"answer":"How libraries have changed over the centuries, for instance, or...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/4.mp3"},{"answer":"how different countries organise them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/5.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think, Trudie?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe we should concentrate on this country, and try and relate the changes in libraries to external developments,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/7.mp3"},{"answer":"like the fact that far more people can read than a century ago,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and that the local population may speak lots of different languages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/9.mp3"},{"answer":"We could include something about changes in the source of funding, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but remember we're only supposed to write a short paper,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/11.mp3"},{"answer":"so it's probably best if we don't go into funding in any detail.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, shall we just brainstorm a few ideas, to get started?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/14.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/15.mp3"},{"answer":"We obviously need to look at the impact of new technology, particularly the internet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Now that lots of books have been digitalised, people can access them from their own computers at home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/17.mp3"},{"answer":"And if everyone did that, libraries would be obsolete.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/19.mp3"},{"answer":"But the digitalised books that are available online for free are mostly out of copyright, aren't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/20.mp3"},{"answer":"And copyright in this country lasts for 70 years after the author dies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/21.mp3"},{"answer":"So you won't find the latest best-seller or up-to-date information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/22.mp3"},{"answer":"That's an important point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, I find it hard to concentrate when I'm reading a long text on a screen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd much rather read a physical book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And it takes longer to read on a screen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I prefer it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose it's just a personal preference.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I expect that libraries will go on evolving in the next few years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Some have already become centres where community activities take place,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/30.mp3"},{"answer":"like local clubs meeting there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that'll become even more common.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to think so,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and that they'll still be serving their traditional function, but I'm not so sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/34.mp3"},{"answer":"There are financial implications, after all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/35.mp3"},{"answer":"What I'm afraid will happen is that books and magazines will all disappear, and there'll just be rows and rows of computers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/36.mp3"},{"answer":"They won't look anything like the libraries we're used to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we'll see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I've just had an idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Why don't we make an in-depth study of our local public library as background to our paper?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that'd be interesting, and raise all sorts of issues.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's make a list of possible things we could ask about,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/42.mp3"},{"answer":"then work out some sort of structure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/43.mp3"},{"answer":"For instance, um, we could interview some of the staff,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and find out whether the library has its own budget, or if that's controlled by the local council.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/45.mp3"},{"answer":"And what their policies are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I know they don't allow food,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/47.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'd love to find out what types of noise they ban -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/48.mp3"},{"answer":"there always seems to be a lot of talking, but never music.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know if that's a policy or it just happens.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, I've often wondered.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there are things like how the library is affected by employment laws.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose there are rules about working hours, facilities for staff, and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there are other issues relating to the design of the building and how customers use it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Like what measures does the library take to ensure their safety?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/56.mp3"},{"answer":"They'd need floor coverings that aren't slippery, and emergency exits, for instance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and another thing -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/58.mp3"},{"answer":"there's the question of the kind of insurance the library needs to have, in case anyone gets injured.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's something else to find out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/60.mp3"},{"answer":"You know something I've often wondered?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/61.mp3"},{"answer":"What's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you know they've got an archive of local newspapers going back years?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, next to it they've got the diary of a well-known politician from the late 19th century.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder why it's there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know what his connection was with this area?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/66.mp3"},{"answer":"No idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's add it to our list of things to find out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I've just thought -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/69.mp3"},{"answer":"you know people might ask in the library about local organisations, like sports clubs?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I wonder if they keep a database, or whether they just look online.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I quite fancy finding out what the differences are between a library that's open to the public","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/73.mp3"},{"answer":"and one that's part of a museum, for example -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/74.mp3"},{"answer":"they must be very different.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Then something else I'd like to know is...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-3-2023-04-18-00-18-35/76.mp3"}]
